        <object placeholders="1" c4Type="Relationship" c4Technology="EF Core / TCP" c4Description="le a outbox" label="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;%c4Description%&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left&quot;&gt;[%c4Technology%]&lt;/div&gt;" id="e8">
          <mxCell edge="1" parent="1" source="s7" style="endArrow=blockThin;html=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#404040;strokeWidth=1;endFill=1;strokeColor=#828282;elbow=vertical;metaEdit=1;endSize=14;startSize=14;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=16;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=1;exitY=0.25;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" target="s8db">
            <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object placeholders="1" c4Type="Relationship" c4Technology="Pub/Sub" c4Description="publica o aviso" label="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;%c4Description%&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left&quot;&gt;[%c4Technology%]&lt;/div&gt;" id="e9">
          <mxCell edge="1" parent="1" source="s7" style="endArrow=blockThin;html=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#404040;strokeWidth=1;endFill=1;strokeColor=#B85C00;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;elbow=vertical;metaEdit=1;endSize=14;startSize=14;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=16;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=1;exitY=0.75;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" target="s8top">
            <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <mxCell id="n0" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF7E0;strokeColor=#D6B656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#5A4A00;spacing=8;arcSize=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;Como ler este diagrama&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;As caixas azuis sao componentes no mesmo conteiner. Os passos 1 a 6 atendem a requisicao. O passo 7 e um processo de fundo do mesmo deploy e usa CPU sempre alocada.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Legenda C4:&lt;/b&gt; azul claro = componente; tracejado = limite do conteiner; cilindro = banco/topico." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="230" width="270" x="40" y="190" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF7E0;strokeColor=#D6B656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#5A4A00;spacing=8;arcSize=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;O papel do MediatR&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;MediatR e um mediador &lt;b&gt;in-process&lt;/b&gt;: organiza Commands, Queries e Handlers e concentra preocupacoes transversais nos IPipelineBehavior. Ele melhora testabilidade e leitura do codigo.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Quem desacopla Lancamentos do Consolidado e o &lt;b&gt;Pub/Sub&lt;/b&gt;, nao o MediatR." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="290" width="270" x="40" y="470" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n2" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF7E0;strokeColor=#D6B656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#5A4A00;spacing=8;arcSize=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;Por que Outbox?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Salvar no banco e publicar em seguida cria dual-write: o processo pode cair entre as duas operacoes. Com Outbox, lancamento e evento sao confirmados juntos. A publicacao pode ser repetida; o consumidor continua idempotente." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="300" width="270" x="40" y="900" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n3" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF7E0;strokeColor=#D6B656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#5A4A00;spacing=8;arcSize=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;E a consulta (GET /lancamentos)?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;O caminho e o mesmo, so que mais curto:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;endpoint &amp;#8594; MediatR &amp;#8594; &lt;i&gt;ObterExtratoDiarioQueryHandler&lt;/i&gt; &amp;#8594; repositorio &amp;#8594; banco.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Sem o passo 5 (nao ha regra a aplicar) e sem os passos 6 e 7 (nao ha nada a gravar)." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="240" width="270" x="40" y="1300" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
